BIGGEST CAPABILITY JUMP
Long-video attention is becoming an architectural optimization target:
near-lossless hybrid linear/local attention can make premium video
generation scale much better with duration instead of paying quadratic
long-context attention costs.

CHEAPEST PRACTICAL WIN
Do not chase the 8=C3=97B200 headline. Test the INT8 ComfyUI VDN stage on
rented consumer Blackwell first and measure quality-per-dollar against
ordinary H3. If it does not beat the existing accelerated H3 path
economically, keep it only as a long-clip specialist.

